          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "muru’ucangʉ kana’ua sarunai soni, imua kacaua cau iavatu.",
          "chineseText": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
