          "order": 3,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "cucuru macangcangarʉ! miaranau cu koo cumacʉ’ʉra nguani.",
          "chineseText": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
