          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "36-hordequest-find-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "ʉʉ’ʉ iaa! ’isiungasi kita soni, tia kasu muranʉ kitana.",
          "chineseText": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
