          "indigenousText": "cina, tʉni kara ku kipapa kana’ua mukusa cakʉran?",
          "chineseText": "媽媽，我可以跟哥哥一起去溪邊嗎？",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/65786/919408.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/outside/boy-1.png",
